0.1 0.18 0.32 rg BT /F2 10.5 Tf 40.00 462.00 Td (Summary of What the Live Website Does) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 446.00 Td (The Clinic Queue Tracking System is a mobile-responsive web application designed to solve waiting-time) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 432.00 Td (uncertainty for registered patients at busy outpatient department \(OPD\) clinics.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 418.00 Td () Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45.00 404.00 Td (1. Patient Experience \(Mobile-First\): Patients complete in-person front desk registration, receiving a paper) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 390.00 Td (   slip with their token number \(e.g. 021, 022, 023, 024, 025\). On their smartphones, they navigate to the) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 376.00 Td (   website, enter their token, and view live status: their exact place in line, number of patients ahead, an) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 362.00 Td (   approximate wait time \(e.g. 20-30 mins\), an intuitive 5-segment progress bar, and doctor delay disclaimers.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 348.00 Td () Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45.00 334.00 Td (2. Turn Approaching Alert: When a patient is next in line or being called, an eye-catching banner notifies) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 320.00 Td (   them immediately to proceed to Consultation Room 1, reducing waiting-hall crowding.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 306.00 Td () Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45.00 292.00 Td (3. Receptionist Queue Control: Clinic receptionists log into a password-protected dashboard to call the next) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 278.00 Td (   patient with one click. Queue advancement propagates to patient screens instantly without manual reloads.) Tj ET
0.2 0.25 0.3 rg BT /F1 9 Tf 45.00 264.00 Td () Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 9 Tf 45.00 250.00 Td (4. Data Privacy & Zero PHI: The system requires no patient accounts, app installs, or sensitive medical records.) Tj ET
