0.25 0.3 0.35 rg BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40.00 472.00 Td (   For N=4: Min = 4 x 5 = 20 mins; Max = Round\(4 x 7.5 / 5\) x 5 = 30 mins -> Displays '20-30 minutes'.) Tj ET
0.1 0.15 0.25 rg BT /F2 8.5 Tf 40.00 457.00 Td (3. Turn Approaching Trigger: When N <= 1, inline alert activates: 'Your turn is approaching!') Tj ET
